{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Point Simulator</strong> is a unique business simulator where you manage a network of delivery points in a challenging world of competition and informal schemes. In this game you will not only have to develop your delivery points, but also face such challenges as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gray market and smuggling:</strong> sell counterfeit goods, take risks on lotteries, but don't forget about responsibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competition and attacks:</strong> attack your competitors, or defend yourself against their attacks using your financial resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illegal transactions:</strong> take advantage of every opportunity to increase your profits, but keep in mind - every choice has consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your strategy, manage your resources, and decide how far you're willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a risk in auctions for collectibles and sell them, participate in raffles and improve your delivery points to take them to the next level.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 orders delivered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672790/3100b2acade7d2caccc067ec4ae330d7045eb651.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the business!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672790/8dd6613ccc97201ac5de3f1c6eaa44c9781cfb4b.jpg"},{"name":"Monopolist in miniature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672790/3a139c0986ba22b40e405d0efe008fb8dd754293.jpg"},{"name":"Season of Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672790/2eca91f89c266bda102eb5724d05166b100ff673.jpg"},{"name":"Honest business only","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672790/d475e143ba